/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Department of Journalism and Mass Communication took the Social Justice Day Pledge on September 15, 2023 at 11.30 a.m. The pledge reminds us about the social responsibilities of individuals to protect and cherish social justice. Students, being the young generation, initiators of change, learnt about the importance of social justice and promised to strive for the justice of every individual despite caste and creed. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
