/ActualText (The cultural club of Alagappa University organized ALUTES 2023 on October 4, 5, and 6, 2023, and conducted various competitions. The students of journalism and mass communication participated in various competitions like skit, mime, group dance, mimicry, solo singing, art, elocution, etc. They secured awards for skit, mimicry, English poetry, and Tamil elocution.)
