325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The conference ended with a concluding ceremony. Dr. N. Arunachalam, Head of the Department, Department of Journalism and Mass Communication, welcomed the gathering and spoke about the successfully conducted conference. Prof. G. Ravi, vice chancellor of Alagappa University, delivered the presidential address. He appreciated the organizing committee for bringing a book with all the research papers in a short span of time. Thiru. M. M. Abdhulla, Member of Parliament, Pudhukottai, delivered the keynote address. He appreciated the paper presenters and awarded them with certificates of appreciation.  Dr. K. Krishnamoorthi, Head of the Department, Department of History thanked the participants and dignitaries for their presence. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
