/ActualText (A special invited lecture on news reporting will be held on November 30, 2023. Thiru. G. Bharanidaran, Assistant Professor, Department of Visual Communication, Jamal Mohamad College, Tiruchirappalli, acted as a resource person. The students gained knowledge about the process of news writing and methods to do it online. They tried out a few exercises with the guidance of Thiru. G. Bharanidaran , to understand the practical application of the lecture.)
