/ActualText (The day started with refurbishment at the Shivan Temple in the village. Post breakfast, they organised a programme for women's empowerment involving the people of the village. After lunch, students took a survey about government schemes utilized by the people of the village. The students of the Theatre and film studies presented a street play at the intersection of Kandanur and Palayur. They ended the day with an interaction session with games and other activities.)
