362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The Department of Journalism and Mass Communication collaborated with the Department of Lifelong Learning in conducting a national colloquium on life skills for employability in mass media on December 12, 2023, at the convocation seminar hall. Prof. G. Ravi, vice chancellor of Alagappa University presided and inaugurated the National Colloquium. Prof. V. Manickavasagam, Accreditation Advisor and former registrar of Alagappa University delivered the keynote address. He stressed the importance of life skills for all professionals, mainly for mass media students. Students from various departments of Alagappa University participated and presented their research papers. These research articles were combined and published as a book by both departments.)
/E (The Department of Journalism and Mass Communication collaborated with the Department of Lifelong Learning in conducting a national colloquium on life skills for employability in mass media on December 12, 2023, at the convocation seminar hall. Prof. G. Ravi, vice chancellor of Alagappa University presided and inaugurated the National Colloquium. Prof. V. Manickavasagam, Accreditation Advisor and former registrar of Alagappa University delivered the keynote address. He stressed the importance of life skills for all professionals, mainly for mass media students. Students from various departments of Alagappa University participated and presented their research papers. These research articles were combined and published as a book by both departments.)
