/T (At the heart of "The Midnight Library" is the character of Nora Seed, who finds herself in a mysterious library between life and death, where each book on the shelves represents a different life she could have lived. As Nora navigates these alternate realities, she is confronted with the consequences of her choices and the paths not taken. )
